# MANDIBLES: ants act only on what they can see. A follower that loses
# sight of you behind a rock forgets the order half a second later; one
# that can still see you keeps following.
game mandibles
wait 5
cheat mission 1 24
cheat clear
cheat red_store 0
cheat store 1
cheat at 135 90
# t0 behind the rock (the block at 120-151, 96-119), t1 in the open
cheat unit 3 0 135 126
cheat unit 3 0 165 110
hold A
wait 2
release A
wait 2
expect t0_order == 1
expect t1_order == 1
wait 45
expect t0_order == 0
expect t1_order == 1
